  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "thr_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900092,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900093,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1598,
   "y": 168,
   "width": 724,
   "height": 178.75,
   "text": "The repetition guard has two rules\n\n  read-only call  the same call (arguments normalised and sorted)\n                  in 3 of the last 10 iterations, consecutive or not\n  mutating call   the same set of calls on 3 iterations in a row\n\nA turn that executed a tag counts as progress: earlier\noccurrences are forgotten, and it never counts as a repeat.\nIsReadOnly defaults to false on ITool and LlmTool, so a tool\nyou did not flag gets the strict rule. The window is cleared\non the first attempt of a step.",
   "originalText": "The repetition guard has two rules\n\n  read-only call  the same call (arguments normalised and sorted)\n                  in 3 of the last 10 iterations, consecutive or not\n  mutating call   the same set of calls on 3 iterations in a row\n\nA turn that executed a tag counts as progress: earlier\noccurrences are forgotten, and it never counts as a repeat.\nIsReadOnly defaults to false on ITool and LlmTool, so a tool\nyou did not flag gets the strict rule. The window is cleared\non the first attempt of a step.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "disp",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900094,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 431.65,
   "width": 760,
   "height": 237.5,
   "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "disp_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900096,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900097,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1598,
   "y": 449.65,
   "width": 724,
   "height": 162.5,
   "text": "How a call reaches your code\n\nThe step looks each requested call up in Tools by Name\n(exact match, case-sensitive) and runs them one after\nanother, never concurrently. An unknown name, or a tool\nthat throws, goes back to the model as an error tool\nmessage and the loop carries on.\n\nLlmTool wraps yours in traces, metrics and events; a bare\nITool runs as-is, nothing observed unless you emit it.",
   "originalText": "How a call reaches your code\n\nThe step looks each requested call up in Tools by Name\n(exact match, case-sensitive) and runs them one after\nanother, never concurrently. An unknown name, or a tool\nthat throws, goes back to the model as an error tool\nmessage and the loop carries on.\n\nLlmTool wraps yours in traces, metrics and events; a bare\nITool runs as-is, nothing observed unless you emit it.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "cmp",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900098,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900099,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 693.15,
   "width": 760,
   "height": 177.05,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "cmp_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900100,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900101,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1598,
   "y": 711.15,
   "width": 724,
   "height": 113.75,
   "text": "Which exits are errors\n\nThe iteration cap is the only one that fails the result: a\nbackstop for a genuine runaway. The repetition cut and the\ntool stop both succeed with FinishReason.Stop and set\nToolLoopStopMessage, so a derived step can tell them from an\nanswer the model chose to give.",
   "originalText": "Which exits are errors\n\nThe iteration cap is the only one that fails the result: a\nbackstop for a genuine runaway. The repetition cut and the\ntool stop both succeed with FinishReason.Stop and set\nToolLoopStopMessage, so a derived step can tell them from an\nanswer the model chose to give.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "foot",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900102,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900103,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1130,
   "width": 1740.96,
   "height": 16.25,
   "text": "Verified against BaseLlmStep.LlmInvocation.cs: 24-34 (cap), 107-115 (final), 139-142 and 237-343 (repetition guard), 185-197 and 496-501 (tool stop), 345-362 (StopWithMessage), 421 (dispatch); BaseLlmStep.cs:106,299.",
   "originalText": "Verified against BaseLlmStep.LlmInvocation.cs: 24-34 (cap), 107-115 (final), 139-142 and 237-343 (repetition guard), 185-197 and 496-501 (tool stop), 345-362 (StopWithMessage), 421 (dispatch); BaseLlmStep.cs:106,299.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
